From 86fae07fac6e331715ffdc79097ed69b0abfb041 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Walker <59085866+jaso1000@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:16:36 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Fold3/Telstra: outgoing call media+connect+hangup, P-ANI in
 REGISTER, priv-app manifest

- Start RTP threads and report callSessionInitiated when the INVITE is answered
  with a direct 200 OK + SDP (no 183/precondition), as Telstra does
- Hang up outgoing calls with a proper BYE; route cancel/BYE to the active call
- Send P-Access-Network-Info (real serving LTE cell) in REGISTER; Telstra 403s
  the authenticated REGISTER without it
- Fix upstream syntax error (unclosed paren in mySdp)
- Run as privileged app: drop sharedUserId=system, request the permissions
  system uid used to grant implicitly (incl. CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT so the mic
  isn't silenced during calls), drop protected-broadcast
- Use prebuilt librnnoise_jni.so instead of building the rnnoise submodule

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
